\f(CRto_xml\fP/\f(CRto_xml($opts)\fP Serialize jq value into XML.
.br
Assumes object representation if input is an object, and nested arrays if input is an array.
.br
Will automatically add a root \f(CRdoc\fP element if jq value has more than one root element.
.br
If a \f(CR#seq\fP is found on at least one element all siblings will be sorted by sequence number. Attributes are always sorted.
