.\}
Text nodes as \f(CR#text\fP.
.RE
.br
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\-\h'+01'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
Comment nodes as \f(CR#comment\fP keys.
.RE
.br
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\-\h'+01'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
For explicit sibling ordering \f(CR#seq\fP keys with a number, can be negative, assumed zero if missing.
.RE
.br
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\-\h'+01'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
Child element with only text as \f(CR<name>\fP key with text as value.
.RE
